    - text: "mcp-trinity extends mcp-project-context's single-format pattern (host-side context injection) to all three IANA-registered FAF formats — .faf, .fafm, .fafa — through both ecosystem exposure surfaces: the Server Card _meta block and a self-published ai-catalog.json."
