    - text: "Both exposure mechanisms this repo demonstrates — the MCP Server Card _meta block and a self-published ai-catalog.json — were already running in production at faf.one and context.faf.one before this repo existed. This is the minimal, forkable extraction of that pattern."
      id: "mechanisms-already-proven"
