    - text: "Distribution: a published npm package (bin `mcp-trinity`) AND a GitHub template. The three source files (project.faf, project.fafm, .well-known/fafa) ship with the package so a fork is a working discovery target on clone. The three IANA-registered formats are the worked example — the contribution is the two-surface pattern."
